<title>UK: SBC SETS WARRANTS ON AT &amp; T CORP.</title>
<headline>SBC SETS WARRANTS ON AT &amp; T CORP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 25 million European-style call warrants, on AT &amp; T Corp, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $35.00		    PREMIUM	8.68 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.32 CHF (INDICATIVE) GEARING	4.60 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	21.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	15.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $40.25</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    SBCSTOCK4</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
